# Map UI & Viewport

## UI element chain

- `InGameState.UiRoot` → children walk to `MapUiElement`.
- Visibility: `UiElement.Flags` bit `0x0B`. Shift `+0x368`, default shift `+0x370`, zoom `+0x3A8`.

## Viewport logic

- `MapViewportLogic` / `Poe2Live.MapViewport` (Core) — shared math for large map vs minimap rects.
- `MapViewsMerger` — combine map read paths; test changes in `MapViewportLogicTests`.

## Draw policy (Overlay)

- `MapOverlayDrawPolicy` decides when to draw on large map vs minimap vs world.
- Respect `ShowTerrain`, map visibility, and path layer toggles (`ShowPathMap`, `ShowPathMinimap`).
- Player blip optional (`ShowPlayerBlip`).

## Alignment

- Overlay anchors to game client area; UI scale from window height (`winH/1600`).
- Map lock / shift / zoom read live each tick — don't cache across frames incorrectly.

## Diagnostics

- `_mapDiag` / `MapDiag` fields in `RadarState` for dashboard troubleshooting — extend when adding map features.
